  'Each red dot starts on this plane. The cloud is a 2D Gaussian — variation survives in both horizontal directions. Drag the slider (or press Play) to send every point upward.');
pickPlane(OUT_Y, 'Output: a 1D line',
  'All trajectories land packed onto one short segment near the back edge. The layer squeezes spread along one dimension — the second dimension of variation is lost.');
